(Chinese): In the tradition of Chinese New Year, Chinese families as well as family always have time to get together and eat together, while cooking is also in line with Chinese beliefs. There are many kinds of food such as fish, pork, chicken, duck, vegetables, fruits that glorify the Chinese New Year.
Here are nine types of fruit dishes that will give you glory on the occasion of Chinese New Year.
Colors are often symbolic during the New Year celebrations, and foods such as red, orange, green, or gold are considered blissful. This is one of the reasons why citrus fruits, oranges, red fruits and pomegranates are popular fruits for gifts. The color is believed to represent the following:
White: bad luck, loss of mourning Red: happiness, purity Orange: happiness, good luck, gold or yellow: happiness, prosperity Green: good luck, harmony Fish Fish is a symbol of good fortune, harmony and prosperity, and the Chinese believe that when eating fish, it will bring glory, happiness, gold, silver, flow into the business, eat rich and have happiness in the family.
