Dr. Sok Touch: Cambodia uses a colorful policy but has the same direction
(Phnom Penh): Speaking in front of students, lawyers and journalists, Dr. Sok Touch, President of the Royal Academy of Cambodia, said that Cambodia uses a colorful policy, but with the same goal, and if anyone benefits, they will be arrested.
Dr. Sok Touch made the remarks on the morning of February 1, 2019 in a roundtable discussion on "The latest political situation of the former CNRP" in which the Minister was present at the ceremony. Accompanying the Prime Minister, Mr. Sea Mao, Member of the Legal Council and Dr. Diep Sophal, Researcher of History and International Relations.
Mr. Sok Touch said: "Cambodia uses colorful foreign policy, not neutral Cambodia, they talk neutral, they talk about the alliance, they talk about foreign policy, it is multi-colored politics, but with the same direction is to catch and who benefits "Arrested."
At the same time, Mr. Sok Touch stated that only foreign policy does not do that, any country that benefits itself is to benefit others as well, so does not mean that Cambodia shakes hands with China alone No, Cambodia joins hands with all countries in the world, but if this handshake does not benefit each other, it will not be possible because Cambodia is a small country, big countries are waiting Pants.
Mr. Sok Touch questioned that when the Cambodian leadership, led by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, shook hands with the US leadership, no opposition or international group shouted. But shaking hands with Chinese President Xi Jinping has always been met with criticism from opposition and international groups.
