In order to strengthen the measures to ensure stability, security and social order, the General Commission of the National Police instructs the heads of departments, units and the Capital-Provincial Police Commissions, focusing on the following tasks:
* First, pay attention to collecting information related to the security situation, public order, especially to grasp the tactics of activities that cause insecurity or incitement to cause social unrest.
