Delegation from the Ministry of Interior explains to the Supreme Advisory Council on sub-national work efficiency and crime suppression
(Phnom Penh): The delegation of the Ministry of Interior led by Mr. Sak Setha, Secretary of State of the Ministry of Interior, on January 31, 2019, attended a meeting to explain and clarify to the Supreme Advisory Council and advise on some work, including effective work. Sub-national and the suppression of other crimes as well.
