This promotion by the Governor of Phnom Penh took place this morning, January 31, 2019, during a meeting to discuss the repair of chicken nests in Phnom Penh at the Capital Hall with the participation of the 12 Khan authorities. And specialized departments under the administration of Phnom Penh.
