Minister of Social Affairs: The Ministry has achieved many fruitful results to help the social sector and veterans throughout the country throughout 2018
(Phnom Penh): Mr. Vong Soth, Minister of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation, said that the Ministry of Social Affairs in 2018, the Ministry has achieved many fruitful results for the social sector and veterans throughout the country.
The Minister of Social Affairs added that the progress made by the Ministry of Social Affairs, Veterans and Youth Rehabilitation in the past is due to the high commitment of all levels of civil servants and good cooperation from relevant ministries, institutions, local authorities, partner organizations and philanthropists. I congratulate you on this glorious achievement.
In addition, the Minister pointed out that all the fruitful results include:
1: Social welfare services for the poor, vulnerable, children, the elderly, former civil servants and veterans have been strengthened and transformed from relief services to a well-functioning social security system.
2. The welfare of children continues to grow. All forms of child exploitation, violence against children, use of child labor, child prostitution, child trafficking, and other forms of child immorality are prevented and prevented. Step by step.
3. The welfare sector for the disabled is given high attention, such as rehabilitation, vocational training, job creation for the disabled, especially the implementation of the policy to support the poor with disabilities in the community.
4: The welfare of the elderly is taken care of on a regular basis. Elderly associations have been set up in communes to help alleviate the hardships of the elderly. Training human resources to serve the care of the elderly as well.
5: Veterans sector has continued to strengthen and expand its activities vigorously and has achieved fruitful results continuously. And the family was very enthusiastic.
6. The social security system for civil servants and veterans has been improved through the efficient, accountable and timely provision of the banking system. Evolution of the national economy.
7. Promote the increase in the number of social workers through the National Institute of Social Affairs to serve the social sector in the intermediate and higher levels by hundreds per year in accordance with the needs of society, economic and political trends in the context of the current globalization.
Mr. Vong Soth said this at the opening ceremony of the meeting to review the results of 2018 and the direction of implementation of the Ministry of Social Affairs to be held on January 30, 2019 in Battambang province.
Once again, Mr. Vong Soth expects that our meeting will address the challenges and long-term vision to solve together in a timely, effective and efficient manner.
