(Phnom Penh): In order to maintain security, safety, order and public order during the Chinese and Vietnamese New Year, which will take place from February 4 to 6, 2019, the Phnom Penh Municipal Administration has banned the burning of fireworks. And cause all kinds of explosions.
The announcement of Phnom Penh Capital Administration introduced to the following departments, units, Khans, Sangkats, Associations, Private Companies, NGOs and the public in Phnom Penh 7 points as follows:
1: Absolutely forbidden: no fireworks, firecrackers or all kinds of house noise during the festival, no gambling of any kind and all kinds of religious or traditional unauthorized marches are prohibited .
2. In all places of entertainment, departments, units, factories, enterprises, homes must maintain security, safety, public order, dignity and be careful to light candles, incense, paper, electric stoves that can cause fires eventually. In particular, the burning of paper must use metal containers or earthen pots to burn, it is strictly forbidden to burn on the sidewalk or chest of public roads.
3. From now on, the competent authorities at all levels must take the strictest measures to prevent the import of fireworks of all kinds through the entrance of Phnom Penh and to confiscate these items that are on sale everywhere. In Phnom Penh.
4. All units, Khans and Sangkats shall disseminate instructions to government officials, employees, subordinate forces and local people to implement this instruction effectively.
5. The Department of Cult and Religion of Phnom Penh shall invite Chinese and Vietnamese associations to disseminate the above content widely.
6: Phnom Penh Municipal Police, Phnom Penh Gendarmerie Command and Command | The Special Military Zone must issue strict orders to its forces to implement them effectively.
Seventh, anyone who violates this instruction or commits an offense that causes social unrest, loss of order, security, safety and public order shall be punished in accordance with the law in force.
