(Phnom Penh): All over the world for the third new season of 2019, the first prize money of 100 million Riel of Echitan Green Tea has found the lucky winner of its grand prize.
A 27-year-old young woman named Div Srey La, currently staying at the National Gendarmerie Headquarters in Tuol Pong Village, Sangkat Choam Chao, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh, is lucky.
"Last weekend, when I took my daughter to the grocery store, she demanded green tea," she told the team, representing the company. The taste of lemon tea, honey, then she bought a bottle from the seller in Toul Pong market and twist the lid for her daughter to eat, suddenly found a prize of 100 million Riel in the bottle cap.
Suddenly, she was very excited and also told her relatives and husband who is a military police officer in the country to know, along with the phone to inform the company through the existing phone number. Will the bottle cap.
She added that after receiving a grand prize of 100 million riels from Echitan green tea, she and her family will buy some land to build a house and save another part to start a family business to support their livelihood in the future.
At the same time, she and her family are also very grateful to Echitan Green Tea Company for creating a great program that can help change her family life for the better.
