Wing Donates $ 35,000 to Improve Garment Association of Cambodia's Education and Health Care System
(Phnom Penh): Wing Specialized Bank (Cambodia) Limited, a leading mobile banking provider in Cambodia, has donated US $ 35,000 to the Garment Manufacturers Association of Cambodia (GMAC) to contribute to the Improving the education, training and health care system for garment workers in Cambodia.
In 2018, Wing Specialized Bank and GMAC collaborated and committed to jointly initiate CSR activities to establish a fund that benefits GMAC garment workers. In particular, the fund is intended for the purchase of books, the construction of libraries and support for other training courses.
