The seven principles proposed by Samdech Krala Hom Sar Kheng and already approved by Samdech Techo Hun Sen include:
First, abolish the specialized offices of ministries and institutions at the municipal and district levels by integrating these specialized offices into the management structure of the municipal and district administrations.
Second, in the integration of this specialized office, the new management structure of the municipal administration will be established as a unit or cluster office for a number of sectors related to the economic sector and the social sector to ensure cost reduction and strengthen the structure. Institutions, with the exception of a number of key priority areas such as education, health, and urbanization, need to be established as separate entities.
Third, the new management structure must be different between the municipal administration in the urban area and the district administration in the rural area. Separately, the management structure of each municipal administration also needs to be organized based on the scope and actual potential of each administration.
Fourth, transfer all the functions that are being performed by the specialized offices of the ministries and institutions at the municipal and district level at present and other appropriate specific field functions to the municipal administration.
Fifth, transfer the financial resources, assets that are being used for specialized offices at the municipal level and the financial resources and other necessary assets of the ministries and institutions to the municipal administration.
Sixth, transfer the staff who are working in the specialized offices at the municipal and district levels and other necessary staff of the ministries and institutions to the municipal administration.
Seventh, some units to be reorganized at the municipal and district levels must be upgraded according to the size of work and the responsibility to provide services directly to the people to encourage and attract competent and skilled officials. Highly suitable to volunteer to work in the municipal administration.
