Lt. Gen. Chan Saran, along with all officers, deputies and soldiers of the Border Protection Training Center, are ready to implement the court order of the Kingdom of Cambodia to take action against the traitors arrested by the court. And call on all compatriots not to believe the call of Sam Rainsy.
