(Phnom Penh): Normally, everyone always wants to succeed in various tasks, whether business, work or do something else, and in order for a job to be successful, each of us must be able to adapt to special circumstances. Be humble in all situations, do not be arrogant.
Oknha Chit Sereysopheak, a young successful entrepreneur, expressed his view that if you all want to be successful, you must remember a slogan that means "Do your own thing, do not do it if you are stupid."
The tycoon said that this slogan is a good warning to business people to remind themselves that if you want to succeed, do not be proud if you do not know and have not been successful.
"Obviously, like myself, I went bankrupt because I was proud of my business, because I was too greedy, not paying attention, not caring and not paying attention," he said. .
He added that the slogan was a good reminder for himself not to walk the path of pride again, and any decision must be listened to a lot, because most successful people like to listen after listening to them. He will analyze and think carefully before deciding to do something.
Please be informed that Mr. Oknha Chit Serey Sopheak is a successful entrepreneur, he currently manages 14 businesses, including: cosmetics, food, coffee, land and so on.
With the success of many businesses, Mr. Oknha also shared his experience of managing multiple businesses at the same time.
"Of course, managing multiple businesses at the same time is not easy, obviously I do not have enough time to manage, but what I have is to persevere and be patient because you "Most successes do not have a business in hand, but start from scratch."
"In addition to perseverance, I have years of experience in management, combined with self-discipline and listening to the opinions of those around me."
Meeting of the Ministry of Agriculture to discuss with Vietnamese rice traders on the issue of falling rice prices will be held on January 30!
(Phnom Penh): The spokesperson of the Ministry of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, Ms. Vuthy, told Fresh News on the afternoon of January 28, 2019 that the meeting to find a solution to the problem of air (IR) of farmers between The Ministry of Agriculture and Vietnamese traders in the rice sector in Cambodia will be held on January 30, 2019 at the Ministry of Agriculture.
He said that the meeting was held to increase rice trade relations with the Vietnamese side to find out why the Vietnamese side in the rice sector seems to be less active than before on the purchase of rice. Concerns for farmers harvesting e-rice in border provinces.
Ms. Vuthy stated that the meeting is scheduled to be held on January 30 to find out why the Vietnamese side did not rush to buy rice from Cambodia because E-rice on the Cambodian-Vietnamese border is dependent on the Vietnamese market. "On the other hand, fragrant rice does not have a problem with falling prices."
Please be informed that Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, on January 28, 2019, on the occasion of the appointment of the new Director of Kampong Cham Provincial Department of Agriculture, ordered the Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries to hold an emergency meeting at the invitation of the Department. Involve companies or traders collecting rice to learn about the problem of low rice prices.
