A young man who brought his girlfriend to a guesthouse was informed by the mother of the woman that she was handcuffed by the police
(Phnom Penh): A young man took his girlfriend for a night out until he entered the guesthouse, but was questioned by his mother about breaking into the guesthouse until he complained to the police and handcuffed the man in the factory while he was working.
The arrest took place on January 28, 2019 in Trapeang Po village, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Senchey, Phnom Penh.
Suspect's name is Kheng Chetra, 25 years old. Occupation: Factory worker. He lives in a rented house in Prey Tea 1 village, Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Senchey. The victim, 15-year-old S.S.K. (minor), was a factory worker living in Sangkat Choam Chao III, Khan Por Sen Chey.
When entering the room, the suspect gave the victim a bath and came up to bed with the suspect caressing, but the victim refused until about 5 am on January 27, 2019, then the suspect Began to rape again, the victim agreed to surrender before going home.
The police officer continued that on January 27, 2019 at 10:30 AM, the mother of the victim asked her daughter to find out the story and complained to the police at the 3rd Chao Chao Post to intervene until the 28th at 9:00 AM The victim's mother called the suspect out of the factory with the police and detained the suspect for questioning at the police station.
