On January 14, 2019, Mr. Chheun Sophon issued a summons to Mr. Hin Nakry, Chief of Chroy Sdao Commune, Mr. Ton Sarith, Member of Chroy Sdao Commune Council and Mr. Uth Sarin, Member of Chroy Sdao Commune Council to appear at Battambang Provincial Court. On the morning of January 28, 2019, according to the complaint of the former Chroy Sdao police chief, Hem Sophon.
However, the local people did not seem to be satisfied with this lawsuit, claiming that Hem Sophon, an official who did not respect the law on free shooting, threatened the people at will and instead complained to the commune chief and commune council. . In addition, people would like to ask the Minister of Justice to review this work, because this former post chief used to shoot in Battambang province.
