After assuming the position of Chroy Sdao Commune Chief on January 6, 2018, he strived to eliminate all the inactivity of his subordinates in order to better serve the people as voters. On the other hand, Mr. Hem Sophon, Chief of Chroy Sdao Commune Police Station, asked lower-level officials to negotiate with him as the commune chief to open a chicken-gambling casino, which is prohibited by law, so he did not allow it.
