The Royal Government of Cambodia has announced its firm stance in opposition to EU measures on the removal of preferential tariffs. The Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, has stated that he will not trade national sovereignty for aid, as well as threaten to remove Europe's preferential tariffs.
