Senior Minister Kun Kim Holds a Lottery for 32 Families of Cambodian Veterans in Snuol District, Kratie Province
(Kratie): 32 families of veterans in Kratie province were provided with houses and plots by Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and President of the Cambodian Veterans Association.
In fact, on January 26, 2019, Senior Minister Kun Kim, Vice President and Secretary General of the Cambodian Veterans Association, held a lottery to rank houses and land. The ceremony was held in Sambour Sen Chey village, Svay Chreah commune, Snoul district, Kratie province, with the participation of the Deputy Governor of Kratie Province and the leaders of the Kratie Provincial Association as well as Kampong Cham.
On that occasion, Senior Minister Kun Kim also brought greetings from Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to the members here that Samdech Lok misses and always thinks of all members, especially those who have a life. Deficit by providing land and building houses, as we have all seen.
At the same time, the Senior Minister and Secretary-General commended the leaders of the provincial association for their efforts in clearing land, dividing it into lots and building 20 of Samdech's gift houses on 44 projects and are continuing to build according to plan.
In addition, Senior Minister Kun Kim instructed the provincial governor to support our brothers and sisters in the situation where they have just settled and there is a shortage in this village far from the water source, and also urged the province to move the philanthropist movement to Dig a well for you to use, which already has two wells in front of you.
The Secretary-General urged the leaders of the provincial associations at all levels to continue to update the veterans in the province to understand the living conditions of each member, strive to take care of the sick by sending them to the hospital on time.
At the same time, the 32 families of veterans who received houses and land were very happy and deeply grateful to Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister and President of the Cambodian Veterans Association, who has always considered their well-being. Land to them, they wish both Samdech and their families good luck, glory, happiness, prosperity and continue to be the Prime Minister forever.
