(Phnom Penh): Despite measures to promote the use of the riel, the amount used is still low compared to the general currency. Therefore, Mr. Chea Chanto, Governor General of the National Bank of Cambodia, called on all departments and units under the National Bank to continue to implement measures to promote the use of the riel.
The request of the Governor-General of the National Bank of Cambodia was made on the occasion of his participation in the closing ceremony of the meeting to review the work results of 2018 and the work direction of 2019 of the National Bank of Cambodia on January 26, 2019.
Mr. Chea Chanto said that although the measures to promote the use of the riel in the past have increased the amount of riel and deposits in riel, this amount is still low compared to the general currency. This continues to make the implementation of monetary policy incomplete.
He added that from international experience, the success of promoting the use of the national currency requires regular and long-term efforts with the cooperation of all stakeholders.
He added that in addition, you should also pay attention that due to the trend of changes in the value of the US dollar, especially the currencies of countries in the region, Cambodia may also be under pressure. In this situation, exchange rate policy must continue to be carefully implemented and in line with economic fundamentals to maintain exchange rate stability and avoid the impact on confidence and macroeconomic stability.
Police Detain 9 Suspects in Drug Trafficking and Use Case in Russey Keo District
(Phnom Penh): Russey Keo District Police Force led by Lieutenant Colonel Koul Yi, District Inspector, investigated and cracked down on drug trafficking and use of 9 people, including 2 women, confiscated some relevant exhibits and 10 packages of drugs in Sangkat 3.
This operation took place from the afternoon to the evening of January 26, 2019 at Group 6, Village 3, Sangkat Chrang Chamres 1, along the concrete road in Group 4, Boeung Salang Village, Sangkat Russey Keo and at points along National Road No. 5, Group 7, Village B2, Sangkat Chrang Chamres 2, Khan Russey Keo.
Lt. Col. Koul Yi confirmed that prior to the arrest of the nine suspects, due to the research and cooperation of the people to find a good time to pursue a raid and confiscate drug paraphernalia. Some and 10 packs of drugs while they were gathering, smoking and drug trafficking.
He added that the nine male and female suspects and exhibits related to the activities were brought for further questioning at the district inspectorate to build a case to be sent to the Phnom Penh Municipal Court to proceed with the procedure. Marie Time Group's $ 30 Million Modern Office Building Groundbreaking Ceremony
(Phnom Penh): Marie Time Asset Company, a subsidiary of Mary Time Group, on January 27, 2019, held a groundbreaking ceremony for the construction of "International Class Office Building" worth about $ 30 million under the presidency of Mr. Oknha. Heng Sethy, CEO of MaryTime Group and his wife, as well as many distinguished guests.
The 24-storey office building, which began to hit the ground running, is located along Samdech Techo Hun Sen Blvd. (60 meters), which will become a potential business area packed with modern buildings, an international business center.
Today, MaryTime Group has achieved its vision to become one of the leading diversified investment and development companies in Cambodia and the region, expanding into key areas such as land and real estate development.
In addition, MaryTime Group is also developing a five-star SEA SENSE resort in Koh Sramoch, Sihanoukville, including bungalows, hotels, family villas, casinos, restaurants with a variety of Khmer and foreign cuisines, the first phase is underway. And will be completed by the end of 2019. The second and third phases will be completed by the end of 2023.
After the construction of this international office building, MaryTime Group will start implementing other major projects in its master business plan to contribute to the development of the country.
