At the conference, the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia considered that Samdech Techo Hun Sen's visit was a complete and successful achievement by deepening political trust and enhancing practical cooperation between the two countries. Operation to enforce security laws as well as cultural exchanges for the better.
The following is the full text of the Chinese Ambassador to Cambodia's press conference:
* During Samdech Techo Hun Sen's visit to China, the two sides have deepened political trust as well as enhanced practical cooperation between the two countries, strengthened cooperation in law enforcement, security and cultural exchanges. More good. Through this visit, we feel like a complete and successful visit.
During the visit, Samdech Techo also met with Chinese President Xi Jinping, Chinese Premier Li Keqiang, Chinese National People's Congress Chairman Li Zhaoxu and Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference Chairman Wang Yang. Both sides highly valued Cambodia and China as steel friends and agreed to provide high-level exchanges, agreeing to better coordinate strategic linkages between the two countries.
* The Chinese Ambassador was interested in the action plan and will provide a master plan for the development of Cambodia-China relations as well as directions for bilateral relations. He also believes that this action plan will provide a clear master plan for the development of bilateral relations between China and Cambodia in the next 60 years and beyond.
Both Cambodia and China are committed to further deepening cooperation. The two sides will link each other's strategies, especially linking the Belt and Road Initiative with Cambodia's Rectangular Strategy, to deepen cooperation in the areas of transportation, energy, trade and livelihoods. Of the people as well.
* Cambodia is rich in good quality rice, so if the two sides have closer cooperation in the agricultural sector, we will build a number of factories to process Cambodian rice into a high quality product and make it work. Cooperation between the two countries is even better.
* He believes that implementation will be even better, especially in planning the Tourism and Culture Year as well as the Law Enforcement Year, and we will have more campaigns and activities to enhance the cooperation between Cambodia and China. To go deeper. Kratie Military Operations Area Defends the Royal Government of Cambodia and Prepares to Defeat Sam Rainsy
