He said that Borey Arata has invested in 7 hectares of land with a total of 737 houses, the first part has a total of 233 houses, the second part has a total of 269 houses and the third part has a total house. 235 houses. Arata Japan Borey project is a kind of residential house, detached villa, twin villa, hybrid villa and shop house with modern style accompanied by green nature.
