Official Opening Ceremony of Prince MK Bank at Borey Koh Pich Hall, Phnom Penh
(Phnom Penh): Prince Bank of Cambodia on January 25, 2019 officially held its inauguration ceremony at Koh Pich Borey Hall after receiving a license from the National Bank of Cambodia on July 18, 2018 to carry out banking operations.
Before becoming a commercial bank, Prince Financial Institution started its business in 2015 as a private microfinance institution under the name Prince Finance Plc.
With a favorable business environment, as well as the will of shareholders, as well as a commitment to long-term investment in the banking industry and experienced staff with local market knowledge and talent, Prince Bank SEC is ready to launch. Further business expansion process from 2019 onwards.
The Bank's goal is to expand its business by contributing to the shortcomings of the financial sector, improving the lives of Cambodians and local investors, and contributing to reducing the financial environment gap for people and small and medium enterprises. The average who do not have access to banking services continues to grow daily in a favorable macroeconomic context.
