At the same time, on behalf of the Minister of Education, Youth and Sports, Mr. Touch Visal Sok, he also vowed to continue to support and cooperate with the countries along the Mekong-Lanchang River in the future for the common benefit, especially for the next generation. Benefit from the Mekong River.
In addition, Mr. Chet Chealy, Rector of the Royal University of Phnom Penh (RUPP) expressed his happiness when Cambodian students won the "Final Mekong-Lanchang Governance and Development Final Competition". 4 ".
