It should be noted that this is the fourth year that the Mekong-Lanchang countries, including China, Laos, Myanmar, Thailand, Cambodia and Vietnam, have organized a judicial competition to create a new project. This year, the competition is under the theme of governance and development of the Mekong-Lanchang.
