Donation Hospital of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to Intervention Brigade No. 128 was officially inaugurated
(Stung Treng): Intervention Brigade 128 Hospital, a gift from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and Samdech Kittiprittbandit in Reacheanukul Village, Sangkat Stung Treng, Stung Treng City, was officially inaugurated this morning, January 26, 2019. With the participation of Mr. Khuong Sreng, Governor of Phnom Penh and Mrs. and Governor of Stung Treng, Mr. Mom Saroeun, as well as 12 district governors and many other officials.
Major General Miech Samuth, Commander of the Intervention Brigade No. 128, mentioned the good cooperation with the Phnom Penh Capital Administration as an allied unit, making the Intervention Brigade No. 128 stand in O'Alay area, Siem Pang District, Stung Treng Province. The newly formed unit has undergone a facelift, both in terms of building military bases and infrastructure, as well as improving the lives of soldiers and military families.
The General also mentioned the situation along the border where the 128 units have a good standing with the Lao side and have contributed to make the border area a peaceful border, a developed border and make it easier for people on both sides to communicate with each other. Well, under the recommendation of Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
The hospital, which will be officially inaugurated now, is an achievement and a testament to the thinking of Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittipritthbandit to the Intervention Unit 128 through the Capital Administration for medical examination and treatment for the army and the people in the area. This will reduce the cost of medical treatment and first aid to the people.
Mr. Khuong Sreng stated that a strong nation is strong because of the army, and the army of today is no different from the army of the past, in the roles, duties and obligations of the nation, religion, the King, defending the Constitution, defending the Royal Government, defending the territory and maintaining peace. Peace to the nation, motherland and people.
Please be informed that this is the second time that the delegation of Phnom Penh Capital Administration visited the troops in Unit 128 after forming a sisterhood alliance with Phnom Penh on September 15, 2017, and also coincided with the visit of the army heroes. In front of the Intervention Brigade No. 3 Command, the Intervention Brigade No. 9 and the Border Protection Police Brigade No. 793, Preah Vihear Province.
The construction of this hospital started on February 2, 2018, it is 30 meters long and 7 meters wide, with a gate, which cost about 70,000 USD, which was donated by Samdech Techo Hun Sen and Samdech Kittiprittbandit through the Phnom Penh Capital Administration.
