The working group leader reminded all the working groups, "We need to be aware of the challenges, concerns and necessary requests of the people in the commune by working together to solve those problems for them in time." Time.
"As representatives of the people, we must do everything for the benefit of the people at all times and to serve the people with the highest responsibility," he said.
