Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen Presiding Over the Celebration of the 20th Anniversary of the Army's Birthday
(Phnom Penh): On the morning of Thursday, January 24, 2019, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia and General of the 5th Golden Star, presided over the ceremony. The Royal Cambodian Armed Forces celebrates the 20th anniversary of the birth of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces.
The following are the main remarks made by Samdech Techo Hun Sen to the Cambodian army and people:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen congratulated the 20th Anniversary of the Army Command and thanked General Meas Sophea for leading the Army in the past and thanked all the veterans.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy to see the army grow as it is now.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are still soldiers who eat other people's names. The so-called army has been around since Cambodia reduced its troops after the Paris Agreement.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen revealed that on June 2, 1993, Samdech and General Pol Saroeun were detained at home.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to avoid bloodshed, Samdech told his captors that Samdech Sok Chet should step down and be replaced as Prime Minister.
* Samdech Techo stated that his intention to resign was denied by General Tea Banh and General Ke Kim Yan, and that a bloody war would ensue if Samdech resigned. Because of this threat, the attempt to remove Samdech from the Prime Minister failed.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 1994 there was another attempt to remove Samdech from the post of Prime Minister. These attempts are all aimed at destroying the peace achievement.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that starting from that attempt, Samdech had to consider and prepare a plan to resist and strengthen the army structure. Samdech Techo stated that as long as Samdech is present, a coup will not be allowed.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to resolve the controversy of not recognizing the election results, Samdech and Samdech Krom Preah agreed to form a Royal Government with Samdech and Samdech Krom Preah as the Co-Prime Ministers and as Co-Minister of Defense and United States Minister of Interior.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces was established in 1994 and that the Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and the Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces have different duties. The Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces controls only the Armed Forces, but the Commander-in-Chief of the Armed Forces commands all armed forces and armed forces.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the story of Cambodia in the past, Samdech may be empty, but since 1977, national events have not skipped from Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has said from the beginning that Samdech always focuses on the people's defense because the army is born of the people and does everything for the well-being of the army.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on all troops to participate in maintaining peace, political stability, social security, to implement the policy of safe villages, communes, to fight against theft and other inactivity. Ensure that Cambodian society is peaceful, no matter what the circumstances, no one can destroy the peace.
* Samdech Techo stated that all troops must fight terrorism and defeat the color revolution that seeks to destroy the constitution and democracy in Cambodia. The army must be neutral with the government, not with the rebels.
* Samdech Techo stated that all acts that want to rob power without respecting the Constitution must be destroyed.
* Samdech Techo stated that his remarks were not a threat to anyone, but to strengthen the army and the armed forces to ensure that there was no terrorism and robbery outside the legal framework.
* Samdech Techo stated that the rebels of the city and the rebels in the forest could not be overthrown by the state, even the French even released their forces to protect the yellow vest group. Samdech Techo stated that France can do why Cambodia can not.
* Samdech Techo said that some countries use armed forces to seize power, why Cambodia uses the army to protect the government, why not? There is no justice in this world.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on the army to join other forces to help the people, especially in times of disaster. The army, the children of the people, must help the people.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister called on the army not to bring tears to the eyes of the people, but to keep the army clean and dignified.
* Samdech Techo stated that the army must support law enforcement forces to ensure the protection of forests, fisheries and other natural resources. Samdech Techo continued that the army must not become a logger or protect loggers.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on peacekeepers not to discriminate against the people in the countries where they are carrying out their missions.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen also called on the army to support the national revenue collection force at both the national and sub-national levels and must work to prevent illegal traders and protect those who do business legally.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister continued that not a small number of people should not affect the cleanliness and dignity of the army.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges the implementation of a culture of paying taxes to raise funds for the army and civil servants.
* Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia does not lack the ability to pay the salaries of civil servants like in the 1980s.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that attention must be paid to strengthening the capacity of the army. Samdech continued that training must be done regularly in all skills. Samdech Prime Minister stated that the material is more modern, but people are not modern is equal to no material.
* Samdech Techo urged all officers to know how to use weapons and to know how to use maps and compasses. Sweating on the training ground is better than bleeding on the battlefield.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister called on all troops to try to lose weight.
* Samdech Techo stated that the training of the army must be given high attention and every time discussing the use of the national budget, the use of the budget for this training must be considered.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen urges all forces to take care of all tactics to ensure that when needed they can be used and not left behind.
* Samdech Techo calls on the army to grow vegetables and raise more animals to supplement their daily diet.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that the army must act as a diplomat by having good relations with neighboring countries.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the Cambodian army is not allowed to go to any country without being under the UN flag.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the building of the army is not to wage war, but to build forces to protect peace, if no one invades, no one comes to overthrow the Royal Government, there is no need to use force.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that those who say that Samdech is consolidating power are right.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen thanked all parties for helping to make the army as strong as it is today.
