The Cambodian side highly appreciates China's great achievements through China's reform and opening-up, and sincerely wishes the Chinese side under the leadership of the CPC Central Committee, with Secretary-General Xi Jinping at its core, Leadership will successfully achieve the goals of both centuries.
The Cambodian side believes that the Chinese people will develop China into a modern, prosperous, socialist, democratic, culturally prosperous, harmonious and beautiful country.
At the same time, the Chinese side sincerely wished the Cambodian people to continue to achieve new and great achievements in national development under the auspices of His Majesty King Norodom Sihamoni, King of the Kingdom. Cambodia and under the leadership of the new Royal Government of the Kingdom of Cambodia, headed by Samdech Techo Hun Sen.
