Later, a homeless man arrived and got on a motorcycle and disappeared. Suddenly, the victim saw and shouted that there was a thief who stole a motorcycle and ran after him. Meanwhile, the Tuol Kork district police patrolled and arrested the suspect at Street 230 Bring the district inspector for questioning.
Authorities said that the suspect was a homeless man who slept on the porch of his house, and every time he walked, he stole something to get money to buy tobacco.
