For Grandma Ta Chi, both pagodas, a total of 32 people, each with a budget of 50,000 Riels and a piece of white cloth with a budget of 10,000 Riels as a gift from Samdech Techo and Samdech Kittipritthbandit. They also donated 20 pieces of white cloth and 2 million riels for 20 children living and studying in Wat Phnom Yat.
