EU punishes Russians over poisoning of former Russian spy on British soil
The European Union (EU) on Monday sentenced four Russian intelligence agencies to life in prison for plotting to carry out a chemical weapons attack on a former Russian spy on British soil. 2018. This was released by Reuters on Monday, January 21, 2019.
