(Koh Kong): Mr. Hak Leng, Governor of Mondul Seima District, brought donations from the Cambodian Red Cross Sub-Branch in Mondul Seima District to the people affected by the fire on January 20, 2019 in Thmey Cham Yeam Village, Pak Klang Commune, Mondul Seima District. Koh Kong.
The owner of the house that was destroyed by the fire was named Sao Chhay, 70 years old, who was a priest at Wat Cham Yeam.
Mr. Sao Chhay confirmed that the cause of the house fire was caused by the explosion of the power line. And the door was closed close to the fire, only to find out that it was a surprise for him at the pagoda to prepare for him because today is a holy day.
The house that was destroyed by the fire was 7 meters by 12 meters, 2 floors, stone under the trees, and all the damaged materials were gone, not even the clothes and money.
