According to the report of the director of the company, the company has invested more than $ 8 million to grow yellow bananas on a 500-hectare trial area, of which 100 hectares are being harvested and packaged for export to the market. China and the future plan to expand the cultivated area to 1,500 hectares to meet the needs of the Chinese market.
