A report from the Criminal Police Department of the National Police Commission of the Ministry of Interior, obtained by Fresh News on the evening of January 18, 2018, shows that the assailant who robbed a Chinese boss took nearly 100,000 dollars. Ung Sokun, 42, lives in Prek Russey village, Sangkat Prek Russey, Takhmao city, Kandal province.
