(Phnom Penh): The Lao Embassy in Cambodia on the evening of January 17, 2019 held a celebration of the 70th anniversary of the founding of the Lao People's Army at the Cambodiana Hotel in Phnom Penh.
The ceremony was attended by General Neang Phat, Permanent Secretary of the Ministry of National Defense, Representative of Samdech Pich Sena Tea Banh, Deputy Prime Minister, Minister of National Defense, General Chhum Socheat, Undersecretary of State and Spokesman for the Ministry of National Defense, General Sao Sokha Deputy Commander and Commander of the Gendarmerie, as well as representatives of many friendly countries.
