(Phnom Penh): In order to strengthen the effective management of state land, Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, Minister of Land Management, Urban Planning and Construction, requested the Capital and Provincial Governors to take measures to strengthen the management of state land. This is according to the letter from Deputy Prime Minister Chea Sophara, which was received by Fresh News on January 17, 2019.
