(Pursat): At least two children, siblings, died tragically in a house fire at 4:10 pm on January 15, 2019 in Othokov village. Sangkat Roleap, Pursat City.
This case caused a house measuring 3 meters by 4 meters, thatched roof, 2 meters high galvanized wall, the house of Ta El, male, 35 years old, Khmer Muslim, and his wife Si Theang, 31 years old, living around Andong Ta. Chuk (Ghost Head), O Thkov Village, Sangkat Roleap, Pursat City, completely burnt down.
Sources from the parents of the young victims said that when the mother went to harvest hay about 500 meters from the house, the father went to see the buffalo about 3 kilometers and the eldest son, 9 years old, tied the cows and they Keep the two children at home and the scene away from their home, so no one knows can not come to help in time.
According to the conclusion of the authorities and the people, the fire was caused by two children who used a trigger to make a fire in Chongmi to cause the fire. The damaged materials are: 10 bags of rice, 20 bags of rice and some other materials.
