Swedish tax administration extends support to the General Department of Taxation of Cambodia on technical assistance projects
This meeting is the first meeting at the level of the Director General of the two countries' tax institutions in the Kingdom of Cambodia, which aims to review and discuss the results of the implementation of the Cambodia-Sweden Technical Assistance and Cooperation Project.
Mr. Kong Vibol warmly welcomed the presence of Ms. Katrin Westling Palm and expressed his deep gratitude to the Swedish tax administration for its support and technical assistance through technical assistance projects between the General Department of Taxation and the Swedish Tax Agency since 2016. So far, as well as the bilateral tax cooperation of the tax administrations of the two countries.
He said the reforms were difficult, especially the Change the Mindset, by shifting the mindset of officials from managers to service providers, changing the mindset of taxpayers from trying to evade and defraud. Taxation is an attempt to fulfill our obligations and strengthen fiscal compliance, cultivate the mindset and leadership of leaders at all levels before achieving the present progress.
Meanwhile, Ms. Katrin Westling Palm, Director General of the Swedish Tax Administration, praised and appreciated the results achieved by the General Department of Taxation under the leadership of the Director General in the reform and modernization of the General Administration of Taxation of the General Department of Taxation. Achieving successful results of the implementation of technical assistance projects between the General Department of Taxation and the Swedish Tax Agency in the past.
The Swedish Fiscal Administration has extended its support to the General Department of Taxation by extending the technical assistance project to the General Department of Taxation for an additional six months.
It should be noted that despite the past circumstances, the Swedish Tax Administration still supports the efforts of the General Department of Taxation, an institution with a clear vision to turn the General Department of Taxation into "a credible and trustworthy public institution. "Respect and recognition of the quality and professionalism in tax collection management in order to maintain sustainable economic growth."
