Smart Care Pharmacy 2nd Branch Officially Opened to Supply Modern and High Quality Medical Equipment and Supplies to Cambodians
(Phnom Penh): Smart Care Pharmacy 2nd Branch was officially opened on January 14, 2019 to supply modern and high quality medical equipment and facilities in order to serve the needs of the people for the health of the people throughout. Cambodia. "Smart Care" Pharmacy Branch 2 is located near Wat Mohamandrey, located at # 3B, Street 284, Sangkat Olympic, Khan Chamkarmon, Phnom Penh.
Chea Hongna, General Manager of Smartcare Pharmacy Branch 2, said that Smartcare Pharmacy will import all kinds of medical equipment from many countries such as European Union, USA, Canada, Korea, Taiwan, India, China and other countries. With high quality to serve customers' needs for health through modern equipment with high quality for people across Cambodia.
The inauguration ceremony was also attended by a large number of distinguished guests and a blessing ceremony was held to bless the Blessed Sacrament.
Mr. Chea Hongna said that today, the company has expanded its market to provinces and cities across the country and has two major locations where the first Smartcare pharmacy started operating in October 2014 and the second Smartcare pharmacy started business from January 14, 2019 onwards. The second branch of Smart Care Pharmacy is managed by Ms. Chea Thean Rasy.
At the same time, Mr. Chea Hongna said that the success of this pharmacy under the leadership of Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia has made the Cambodian economy is growing rapidly, our people receive low middle income. In 2018 and get a high average income in 2025, it proves that under the leadership of Samdech Techo, Cambodia is peaceful and proud to develop.
At the same time, the private sector also has the opportunity to expand the scope of its business, and Smartcare Pharmacy also has the opportunity to expand its business branch now and ask for the support of distinguished guests, as well as customers and all citizens of Smartcare Pharmacy Branch. This second.
In addition, Ms. Chea Thean Rasy, Manager of Smart Care Pharmacy Branch 2, said that Smart Care Pharmacy Branch 2 has more than 3,000 kinds of equipment to supply, including sugar meter, orthopedic device when available. Fractures, eyeglasses, surgical equipment, oxygen, gloves and other medical equipment.
