He added that this cooperation has made a significant contribution to the development of the banking sector, strengthening good relations and strengthening the capacity of the two central bank's professional officers, as well as supporting the development of the financial sector and the national economy as a whole. .
"I hope that officials at both the leadership and technical levels will continue to take the spirit of the present and past meetings into high-performance practices for the development of the banking sector and the establishment of a culture of cooperation," he said. It's a good tradition to be even stronger. ”
