Mr. Vongsey Visoth said this in a public forum on macroeconomic management and the 2019 budget at the Ministry of Economy and Finance on January 15, 2019.
Mr. Vongsey Visoth said so after raising some concerns about the flow of investment and the Chinese people in Cambodia when there are many Chinese and Chinese investors.
