Speaking to the team that handed over the prize directly to the house, Mr. Sreng Kimheng, who became the owner of 20 million Riel, said that for a long time, he has always supported and used toothpaste to remove 2 shower gel regularly. Because it can treat gum disease, help whiten teeth and eliminate bad breath well.
