Fire at a grocery store in Russey Keo district started from an electric shock, the police used 6 water trucks to put out the fire
(Phnom Penh): A fire broke out in a stone house selling groceries at a point along the concrete road at house number 55, group 14, Boeung Salang village, Sangkat Russey Keo, Khan Russey Keo this morning, January 14, 2019, but was extinguished. After about 25 minutes, the police intervened and fired.
The report of Mr. Chea Pisey, Governor of Russey Keo District on the above fire accident happened to the owner of the house, No Chheng Kim, female, 45 years old, a salesman, after the intervention of the authorities and Mr. Koul Yi, Police Inspector of Russey Keo District with the authorities. Involved in using 6 fire trucks, using water to help put out 3 fire engines.
Among them, 2 vehicles of Phnom Penh Fire Department and 1 vehicle of Russey Keo District Administration were completely extinguished without spreading the fire to other people's houses within 25 minutes after the incident. Fire at 10:00 p.m.
