At the same time, Dr. Ma Chhoeun stated that it is necessary to maintain and contribute to the protection of security through the implementation of the policy of safe villages and communes by contributing to the destruction, prevention, destruction and prevention of the color revolution.
"The color revolution makes the world full of war, so we all hate the color revolution, we all do not need the color revolution, we must all prevent it," said the head of the Central Working Group for Cheung Prey District. Yes.
Dr. Ma Chhoeun emphasized that we must contribute to building the country in all fields to grow forever, starting from the development in all areas, especially the village, commune, government authorities at all levels and the armed forces of all kinds must work together to build livelihoods. To the people to grow continuously.
"We must all remember that we must be united ... National unity is alive, divided is dead, so we must be united forever, the armed forces of all kinds and the people at all levels," he said. "We must continue to implement the policy of safe villages, communes, eradicate theft and all kinds of crimes."
