The press release states that Mr. Kem Rath Viseth, Secretary of State of the Office of the Council of Ministers will read the welcome message of the King of the Kingdom of Cambodia at the beginning of the meeting on the morning of January 15, 2019.
ACC President Khuon Sodary, Second Vice President of the National Assembly of Cambodia, will make a welcome address, followed by a speech by ICAPP and UNESCO representatives.
