The Presidents of the National Assembly of Cambodia and Laos expressed their pride in the smooth cooperation between the two parliaments, especially the mutual support in the regional and global inter-parliamentary forums, and also signed a memorandum of understanding in Strengthening cooperation with each other.
Ms. Panya Toto thanked and congratulated the organization of the 27th APPF Meeting of the Cambodian Parliament for going well with the important content. At the same time, she observed that Cambodia has made remarkable progress in recent times, which shows the correct leadership of the Cambodian People's Party, which has just won the recent elections. This 2018.
The President of the Lao National Assembly supported the contents of the Memorandum of Understanding signed on this occasion and requested the National Assembly President to continue to strengthen the cooperation between the two parliaments from the leadership to the specialized committee. Have a joint workshop.
