In total, for 34 years as the Prime Minister of Cambodia, Samdech Techo Hun Sen has been at the helm of the Cambodian navy with the utmost care to restore and lead this miserable country to a new era of development. Remarkable sector and helped people to have a better life as well.
Through political messages, the 66-year-old Cambodian prime minister is setting his sights on pushing Cambodian ships to become high-middle-income countries by 2030 and high-income countries by 2050. Many large investment projects with billions of dollars are emerging today.
