MOSCOW (Reuters) - Israel launched an air strike on the Syrian city of Damascus last week and prevented most of the Syrian missile defenses, leaving little damage around the city. Is this an Israeli attack on Syrian forces or not? This is according to a quote from Sputnik newspaper on Monday morning, January 14, 2019.
In fact, the above question was interpreted by a veteran US official, who asked not to be named, saying that it was not entirely Israel's intention if no one was behind it. As the situation in Syria has calmed down, but Israel is launching more attacks on Syria, there is a real reason behind it.
To clarify this, the veteran official recalled an incident that happened recently: an attack by a group that the United States accused of being the Iranian Revolutionary Guards stationed in Syria. In the blue area (neutral area) of Baghdad, Iraq, using artillery in September 2018, after the attack, the United States immediately charged Iranian forces.
The claim was not accepted by both the United States and Iran, as the United States has previously accused Iran of bombing a diplomatic mission in Baghdad last month. Last year, Tehran was immediately dismissed by the government and reiterated to Washington that it was a "completely false accusation" and a stepping stone to US political programs in the region.
Remarks by Samdech Techo Hun Sen on the Occasion of Groundbreaking Ceremony for the Construction of the Third Ring Road through Phnom Penh and Kandal Province at Nearly 300 Million USD
* As a starting point in the opening speech of the construction of the Third Ring Road, Samdech Techo Hun Sen, on behalf of the Cambodian People's Party and on behalf of Samdech himself, thanked the people who voted for the Cambodian People's Party. Samdech Prime Minister said that because of the support of the people, the construction site of the third ring road was opened today.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the reason for the construction of the third ring road now to meet the growth of people and vehicles.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the past, Cambodia had an imbalance between people and means of transportation, but now there is an imbalance between people's means of transportation and roads. In other words, the means of transportation have increased, but the roads are still narrow, which makes the Royal Government work hard to build and expand the roads.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that hard-earned peace is the most important basis for Cambodia's growth.
* Samdech Techo stated that the Third Ring Road is very beneficial for the people and the economy of Cambodia.
The Prime Minister thanked the Prime Minister and the Chinese government for supporting the construction of the third ring road worth nearly 300 million dollars.
* The Prime Minister stated that although the construction of roads and bridges requires borrowing money from abroad, it also saves money to implement the project.
* The head of the Royal Government asked for the understanding of the people who were disturbed by the construction of this ring road.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the construction of roads, bridges, schools is the most equitable benefit for the people.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Cambodia is studying the construction of roads and bridges to connect Kratie and Kampong Thom provinces.
* Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia is currently considering building a road connecting Koh Kong to the border rock and connecting Samlot and Pailin.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that Samdech is really happy with Cambodia's current economic growth.
* The Prime Minister stated that the growth of Cambodia is due to the contribution of the Chinese government.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces that on January 20, he will pay a visit to China, and many economic, trade and investment issues will be discussed in a meeting with the President and Prime Minister of China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that while exporting, efforts must be made to attract tourists to Cambodia to use agricultural products and produce in the country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that by 2025, 5 million Chinese tourists must be attracted. Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the topic of attracting Chinese tourists is also a topic in his visit to China.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the tourism sector is a contribution to the national economy and Cambodia is economically dependent on any one sector and when it closes its nose, it dies.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in 1984, Tevda tested his ability when he was acting Prime Minister, with Cambodia partly drought on land and partly flooding along the Mekong River. Samdech Techo stated that his first message in the National Assembly at that time was not to let any people die because they did not have food to eat.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that Samdech has led this economy very difficult, no one needs to come to teach Samdech.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the game of threatening sanctions is over, and that Samdech used to lead the country with economic sanctions.
* Samdech Techo stated that Cambodia does not want to make enemies with any country, but wants to make friends with all countries in the world, but must not take 16 million Cambodians hostage.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in the house of the opposition activists criticized the Royal Government for not managing the forest, but their house is made of luxury wood.
* The Prime Minister calls for a united vote for Ms. Ke Leng to win a world-class award.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that we must work together to reform to support economic growth.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if sanctions are imposed on Cambodia, Cambodia will enforce strict laws with the opposition, and the sanctioned country has no right to speak on the implementation of Cambodian law.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen announces to Europe again not to make a third mistake for Cambodia by imposing sanctions. The two mistakes they made were their support for the coup d'état overthrowing Norodom Sihanouk and their support for the Khmer Rouge regime at the United Nations, regardless of the plight of the Cambodian people.
* Samdech Techo warns to take action against the opposition if Europe imposes sanctions on Cambodia.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen has announced that if sanctions fall on opposition groups calling for European sanctions, they are ready to flee.
* Samdech Techo stated that if you want the opposition to die and punish Cambodia, but if you want the opposition to live, please come and talk fairly.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on European countries not to use Cambodia's story as a subject for propaganda to continue to be a member of the European Parliament.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that if the Cambodian economy is led in a lazy way, the Royal Government will not have the budget to pay the salaries of officials.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister calls on civil servants to redouble their efforts to provide services to the people, to make the people happy, to respond to the trust of the people who voted for the Cambodian People's Party.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls for joint efforts to double Cambodia's independence, not to give in to the threats of any country.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen calls on people not to risk their lives on the road, but to try to avoid traffic accidents by respecting their own lives and the lives of others.
