Mr. Pech Sophoan: Cambodia is lucky to be free from the genocidal regime and escape the color revolution
(Takeo): Mr. Pich Sophoan, Member of the Central Committee of the Cambodian People's Party and Co-Chair of the National Working Group of the Cambodian People's Party in Prey Kabbas District, told the people that Cambodia is lucky to be free from the genocidal regime. From the day of victory on January 7, 1979 and escaped the color revolution during 2013, which was about to happen due to the treason of the former opposition party.
He said this at the dissemination of the results of the 41st Central Committee Meeting of the 5th mandate of the Cambodian People's Party and the commemoration of the 40th anniversary of the 7 January Victory Day, which was held on 13 January. 2019 is located in Po Romchak Commune, Prey Kabas District, Takeo Province.
