(Phnom Penh): The Phnom Penh Capital Administration has announced on its Facebook page that there is a favor from Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister of Cambodia, in granting land to the people on January 12, 2018. Mr. Khuong Sreng, the Capital Governor, handed over the title deeds to the people in Stung Meanchey Canal.
