Dalan Festival is held in Battambang Province!
(Battambang): Mr. Veng Sakhon, Minister of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries, on January 12, 2019, presided over the Dalan Festival organized by the General Department of Agriculture in collaboration with local authorities, Department of Agriculture, Forestry and Fisheries. Provincial fishing at Tuol Samrong rice seed station in O'Hon village, Boeung Pring commune, Thmor Kol district, Battambang province.
