(Phnom Penh): A devastating fire engulfed a house, with the lives of the wife drifting to the world, leaving a tragedy on the husband and children in the nest. The fire occurred at 1 am on January 12, 2019 in Angkrang village, Sangkat Kraing Thnong, Khan Sen Sok.
