(Phnom Penh): Samdech Techo Hun Sen, Prime Minister of Cambodia, on the evening of January 11, 2019, gave a high honor to meet and have a solidarity meal with nearly 5,000 journalists across the country.
In this third annual meeting, Samdech Techo Hun Sen provided a lot of advice to be a beacon in improving the information sector in Cambodia. The following are the main remarks made by Samdech Techo Hun Sen at this gathering:
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he was very happy to meet with the media again.
* The Prime Minister hopes that the number of journalists attending the meeting will increase in the next meeting, and Samdech will always welcome this meeting.
* Samdech Techo stated that Samdech is becoming a character who has to have many annual meetings, not only journalists, but also artists, Chinese associations, Christians and Khmer-Muslims.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that there are many issues that need to be addressed together, not the duty of any journalist or institution.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen wants a legal study to lead to the control of information technology and counterfeit information crimes.
* Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government, said that European countries are all concerned about information technology crimes and fake information, and that countries also have laws governing these two issues.
* Samdech Techo requested all media institutions to act as mirrors to reflect the real situation in society.
* The head of the Royal Government stated that he wanted the media to be a bridge between the state and the people, from the people to the state, both in politics and other issues.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen supports the views expressed on the behavior of people who do not like to receive useful information.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the media has made efforts to broadcast, but some people do not accept. Samdech Techo said that between news and songs, people prefer songs between news and football, people prefer football.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that some things that happened at the grassroots level were not known to the leaders. In this sense, Samdech Techo asked for information to be a bridge, but to avoid information related to national security.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wanted the media to participate in the criticism to build both the level of political issues, institutions and individuals.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that with only three days left, Samdech has been the Prime Minister for 34 years.
* The Prime Minister stated that even without tariff preferences from Europe, Cambodia would not die.
* Samdech Prime Minister stated that Samdech has just decided that all border crossings will be left with immigration and customs institutions, only other institutions will be eliminated.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wants journalists to contribute to the analysis of the strategic level in the country, region and internationally. Samdech Techo also wants universities in Cambodia to participate in this issue.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he did not agree with the idea of having international standards in the field of information. Samdech Tha only sports have international standards.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that he wanted analysts to research information issues such as the reasons behind the withdrawal of US troops from Syria and the problems that arose after the withdrawal of US troops.
* Samdech Techo, the head of the Royal Government, still wants Cambodian journalists and researchers to study international and international issues, such as the US government's stalemate.
* The Prime Minister continues to call on the media to cover the facts, not to try to be a judge.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that the journalists were not the justice police who went to the police station to seize the car.
* The Prime Minister asks all journalists to join the fight against fake news, because in Cambodia, fake news is happening a lot.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen stated that in order to eliminate false information, it is necessary to jointly disseminate true information.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen did not support the idea of creating a new television. Samdech Techo stated that the existing television has not yet reached its full potential.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister spoke in support of the idea of creating information in English to push information from Cambodia to the world.
* Samdech Techo, Head of the Royal Government, announces to the media that if the campaign campaign is published quickly and accurately and in many languages.
* Samdech Techo Hun Sen called on the media, the Association of Journalists and the Ministry of Information to work hard to improve the capacity of journalists.
* Samdech Techo Prime Minister stated that the owners of the media should not be stingy in releasing money for journalists to study.
* The Prime Minister announced that he would continue to meet with the media in the following years until he resigned as Prime Minister.
