Two Vietnamese nationals arrested for stealing property in Vietnam
(Ratanakkiri): Two men, a father and a son, who are Vietnamese, were arrested by the Svay Rieng Provincial Police on the evening of January 9, 2019, according to the arrest warrant No. 02 / PC 45 dated March 10, 2015 of the Barong Vung Tau Provincial Police Investigation Institute of the Socialist Republic of Vietnam and
Refer to the Notification of the Prosecutor of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Court dated 9 January 2019 on the request for arrest of the Ratanakkiri Provincial Police.
