According to the report, 1,486 helmets and goggles were inspected on January 10, 69 education helmets and 913 glasses were fined.
For the results of the 10-day inspection from January 1 to 10, the police inspected 44,245 vehicles and found 7,048 offending vehicles (79% motorcycles), including education 2, 030 units and fines 5,018 units. Many land pits in Kampong Svay commune, Kien Svay district, Kandal province have been dug up by traders to sell land without any rules
