(Phnom Penh): Three Cambodians living and working in South Korea have been selected to receive the grand prize offered by Wing Specialized Bank (Cambodia) Limited through a remittance program to win prizes from the bank. Wing Specialty.
The three grand prize winners were selected by lottery using the bank's electronic system held at the head office of Wing Specialized Bank on January 9, 2019.
Wing Specialized Bank's Overseas Receipt Service was introduced in February 2018, allowing thousands of Cambodian migrants to send money to Cambodia. The service addresses the concerns of migrant workers who often send money to their families in Cambodia through informal means, which are generally expensive and unreliable.
Wing International Bank's international money transfer service demonstrates the bank's strong commitment to providing Cambodians with access to convenient and affordable financial services to enhance their lives.
