The Minister stated that in the past, the Ministry and its subordinates have been trying to implement the contents of the sub-decree on the implementation of contract agricultural production through the dissemination and training of farmers, farmers, development partners, and participants have gained knowledge such as the power of Negotiation of prices, conditions in the contract, compilation of production groups and the establishment of agricultural communities.
