Mines Authority officials told Fresh News that "Samdech Techo Hun Sen, the Prime Minister and Chairman of the Mines Authority, is deeply saddened by the news that an unexploded ordnance (UXO) accident occurred in Techo Bosbov village, Sraem commune. Choam Ksan district, Preah Vihear province.
