Mr. Phos Sovann, Spokesman of the Ministry of Information, in an interview with Fresh News on the evening of January 9, 2018, said that Mr. Khieu Kanharith has made a request to the cabinet of Samdech Techo Hun Sen to provide opportunities for journalists. Expressed his opinion in a meeting with Samdech Techo and journalists.
