Mr. Phos Sovann also rejected some allegations that there was discrimination or restriction on journalists in the meeting with Samdech Techo. "It's not true," he said. "This meeting provides an opportunity for all journalists who have a valid institution registered with the Ministry of Information, including international media are also allowed to participate."
