(Phnom Penh): A joint operation team consisting of the Investigation and Enforcement Department of the General Department of Immigration in cooperation with the Phnom Penh Municipal Commission under the direct supervision of the Prosecutor's Office on January 9, 2019 arrested a number of Vietnamese men and women. 12 people who came to stay and work illegally in Cambodia.
