Mr. Ros Pharith said this on the morning of January 9, 2019, when he presided over the celebration of the 40th anniversary of the Victory Day on January 7 (January 7, 1979 - January 7, 2019) at the headquarters. Cambodian People's Party, Pong Teuk commune, Romduol district, Svay Rieng province, with the participation of more than 400 people.
