Along with the inauguration of the monument to the end of the Cambodian war, there was also a three-night fireworks celebration celebration from December 29 to 31, 2018. During the three-day celebration of the presence of this win-win political monument, more than 1 million people visited and visited.
This win-win monument represents the heroism of Samdech Hun Sen, who dared to risk his life to travel to Vietnam to ask for Vietnamese forces to help overthrow the genocidal regime of "Pol Pot" and used all means to end the flames of war in Cambodia .
