Can the United States find a reasonable argument to accuse North Korea of producing nuclear weapons unacceptable, while it, as well as Russia, China, Britain, France, India, Pakistan and Israel, also have nuclear weapons?
Kim and his generals are not blind to the presence of 600,000 strong South Korean troops, both men and women and 25,000 US troops, deployed over 60 kilometers of South Korean territory. From the frontier ready for war. Moreover, politicians from Seoul, Tokyo and Washington are always waiting to ignite Pyongyang's regime change.
* So what is the most appropriate solution to do now? If there is not enough reason to persuade North Korea to stop producing nuclear weapons, as the leader believes that only weapons that can guarantee the maintenance of its power, the world may continue to live with the presence of North Korean nuclear weapons. That we are living with the nuclear of India or Israel as well.
This does not mean that we have to agree on North Korea's strategy to develop nuclear weapons, but it is important for the world to have a positive view of the situation so that we can better resolve the issue with North Korea. Efficiency.
