As Cambodia celebrates the 40th anniversary of the January 7 Victory Day, which overthrew the Pol Pot regime, Leang Phaly, head of the Volunteer Doctors Association, Hun Many, confirmed that Samdech Techo Hun Sen had sacrificed a lot to Liberate Cambodia from the dark regime of Pol Pot and the presence of Samdech Techo Hun Sen has made the whole of Cambodia as beautiful as it is today.
Mr. Leng Phaly's statement was made on January 6, 2019 on the occasion of Mr. Hun Many's team of 315 volunteer doctors visiting Wat Slap Leng, Svay Ampea commune, Bor Seth district. 5,469 people in Kampong Speu province for free and also distributed medicine, bread and water to them.
