* First: Salt handicraft is located in Lech Market, Sangkat Prek Phnov, Khan Prek Phnov, Phnom Penh. The team inspected and tested for iodized salt (90PPM) (excess iodine), non-iodized salt. After inspecting that this handicraft has no sanitation law, the committee decided to temporarily suspend the owner to make a law and organize good sanitation.
* Second: On National Road 5, Sangkat Prek Phnov, Khan Prek Phnov, tested 20PPM of iodized salt (iodine deficiency), 70PPM of iodized salt after checking that this handicraft is legal. Provide good hygiene instructions and normal operation and send some samples to the laboratory of General Department of CamControl.
Mr. Kong Vuthy continued that these activities are in accordance with the instructions of the Head of the Royal Government Delegation in charge of the General Department of CamControl and the President of Camcontrol in Phnom Penh. Phnom Penh Special Economic Zone Camcontrol Officers Confiscate Defective Products from Teuk Thla Market, Dey Huy Market and Chhouk Meas Market
