According to Mr. Kouch Chamroeun, today is not the same as 40 years ago, all came together to celebrate to express happiness in the whole country, achieving peace at the pace of progress. A lot of development, including sports is a part that is developing a lot in the Kingdom of Cambodia.
"Throughout Cambodia, we are celebrating sports, which, of course, we are now celebrating the opening of sports events in the province. At the same time, we have sent international racing boats to many districts to compete at Kandal province as well.
Mr. Kouch Chamroeun added that more importantly, the Royal Government is ready to host the 2023 SEA Games, which has the opportunity to train for four years to participate in the competition at that time. He expects that foreign players will come to compete with the players of Kampong Cham, at least such as swimming will also come to compete in Kampong Cham.
Mr. Kouch Chamroeun further stated, "Therefore, our players must be properly prepared, that is, they must be well trained to participate in the upcoming game in 2023." Sent the owner of "Democlinic" to the court in the case of extortion from customers, now Deputy Prosecutor Soeun Moniroth is questioning
(Phnom Penh): The owner of "Democlinic" beauty salon was arrested by the military and sent to court this morning, January 4, 2019, after a cosmetic surgeon in this salon was also sent to court. The court, too. The specialist who performed the cosmetic surgery was Pov Sinath.
