(Phnom Penh): Her Majesty Queen Norodom Monineath Sihanouk, Queen Mother of Cambodia, sends a message to His Excellency General Hing Bun Heang, Deputy Commander-in-Chief of the Royal Cambodian Armed Forces and Commander-in-Chief of the Bodyguard Command and Lok Chumteav Pen Channy Hing Bun Heang. Died of Senator Sok Chum, the mother-in-law and the birth mother.
