Ms. Yog Serey Sophors, President of JLS, said that the agreement between JLS and Life University is to help disseminate and train nursing students to receive scholarships to study and train other trainees to have the opportunity to work. In Japan, too.
She added that for Life University, there is more than 10 years of training experience in nursing. For study in JLS, the company will train the various areas that the trainees have studied as well as other job directions.
She added that in addition to training students to study, the company also trains trainees and workers to work in Japan, working in Japan for three years, but they can apply for two more years. And during the 5 years that he studied and worked in Japan, they were able to bring a lot of experience and knowledge to work in Cambodia as well.
Shocking! A Camry Shark car collided with a fully loaded "container" truck, causing the container of fish oil to collapse, crushing the sugarcane juice stall in front of Koki Market, overflowing the road.
(Central): At least two men were seriously injured when they were trapped in the cabin of a car in a traffic accident between a Camry Shark car and hit the middle of a container truck, causing the shark car to collapse and the front cabin almost completely destroyed. .
Three container trucks exploded on the left rear wheel and one of the tires broke off from the truck near the scene, while a container loaded with fish oil fell to the cane juice shop, spilling fish oil all over the road. Suddenly, the people helped to get one man out, while another was trapped in the cabin of the car, causing a great surprise.
The above horrific traffic accident happened at 2:40 AM on January 4, 2019 on National Road No. 1 in front of Koki Market, Koki Commune, Kien Svay District, Province. Central.
The driver of the car who was trapped in the cabin was named Yang Mach, 35 years old, male, working at the port, residing in Banteay Dek commune, Kien Svay district, Kandal province. The passengers have not yet been identified. The driver of the container truck has not yet been identified, but has been arrested.
Suddenly, two men (one driver and one passenger) were seriously injured, smashed into a glass of blood and trapped in the cabin of the truck, while the container truck exploded three rear left wheels and broke. The tires came out of the truck near the scene, while the container containing the fish oil fell and hit the stall selling sugar cane juice, overflowing with fish oil all over the road.
While the container truck did not run out of speed, it continued for more than 100 meters before stopping and was immediately detained by the people of Taikong, the container truck immediately contacted and handed over to the authorities at that place.
Meanwhile, two men trapped in the cabin of the Kamari Shark car were rescued by the people in cooperation with the police, and one of them was taken to Kien Svay District Referral Hospital by ambulance. Rescue at Calmette Hospital.
The other driver was trapped in the cabin of the car was rescued by residents as well as the authorities for more than 2 hours, still not removed until a team of doctors from Kien Svay district arrived at the scene to help apply strength serum. The injured will continue to evacuate the occupants in the same cabin.
Seeing the difficult situation to get people out, the reporters informed ABC Radio to call the 711 rescue team of the 70th Brigade, cut the metal car and ambulance to intervene because it was more than 2 hours. Remove people.
Immediately after receiving the information, the Deputy Commander of the 70th Brigade ordered the 711 Rescue Team to remove the metal cutting vehicle from the 70th Brigade stronghold on National Road 3 in Po Sen Chey District to the scene in front of Koki Market, Kien Svay District to rescue Iron took people out, but when they arrived at Prek Eang High School near the scene, the victims were rescued by the people and the police, and the rescue team returned to the fort.
Now, after the incident, the measuring force of Kien Svay district came down to the scene to work for a long time, took both vehicles and containers to be stored to wait for a legal settlement.
Citizens can call an ambulance by calling 096 925 4440/088 777 1115. Lt. Gen. Soy Narith further confirmed that all rescue operations (both emergency and fire) are free of charge. Mr. Pa Socheatvong announced to take the position of President of the Cambodian People's Party, Khan Russey Keo, Mr. Chea Pisey was appointed to replace Mr. Thuy Sokhon
