On the occasion of the 40th anniversary of the message to Chinese living in Taiwan, Xi said Beijing has always welcomed the creation of a space for peaceful reunification between the two territories, but will not. Let any form of separatist movement take place in Taiwan.
Xi added that since the people of mainland China and Taiwan are one family, the Taiwan issue is an internal affair that should be resolved through dialogue and consultation between the two sides and there should be no interference. From abroad. The Chinese president also announced that Taiwan would receive long-term peace assurances if it agreed to unite peacefully with China.
Relations between mainland China and Taiwan erupted for the first time since 1949 when a movement led by the Chinese Nationalist Party took control of the island after they lost the Chinese Civil War. Established as the Republic of China in Taiwan.
Beijing does not recognize Taiwan as an independent state, only the island as an autonomous province in Chinese territory, in line with the one-China policy that most countries in the world, including the United States, recognize. That.
But a message to all Chinese people 40 years ago announced the end of Beijing's shelling on Taiwan-controlled islands near China, and since then, unofficial relations between China And Taiwan also resumed. At present, Taiwan covers a total area of 36,197 square kilometers with a total population of over 23.5 million (95% of whom are Han).
