(Phnom Penh): General Chhum Socheat, Undersecretary of State and Spokesperson of the Ministry of National Defense, said that in 2018, the Army cooperated with the patrols to protect and inspect the geographical border posts responsible to control the situation in Along the border line, a total of 5,193 crimes were prevented and suppressed.
